# Supplementary search guidance

Source only, unqualified. ExecutionSnapshot optional `user_guidance:{parent_execution_id,text}` is closed, nonblank/NUL-free and <=4096 UTF-8 bytes; only manual executions permit it. The exact original value is immutable and part of snapshot SHA. None is omitted by serializer, preserving older hashes. Parent ownership/terminal custody is checked by Fleet and Tracker admission; this field does not authorize arbitrary parent access here.

Workflow context retains the snapshot and phase evaluation explicitly treats guidance as quoted supplementary user data. Immutable targets, pinned versions, original verification basis, permissions and credential boundaries remain authoritative. Catalog/profession packages and HMAC transport are unchanged. Active guidance delivery is Fleet original-runtime control, not a new Workflow Task or phase authority.
